    "body": "Oops, left this hanging.\r\n\r\nIn that map, it looks like \"error\" is still mapped to a single interface, but I guess this is a per-interface map with inheritance so that it's possible to override it?\r\n\r\nStill not sure how to do this in practice. Maybe changing Web IDL to have a type like `EventHandler<HashChangeEvent>` or something? @domenic?",
