    "body": ">Also note that some event types are used by multiple interfaces, for example \"error\", where an Event is used for HTMLImageElement, but an ErrorEvent is used in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#runtime-script-errors (target is the global object in at least one call site)\r\n\r\nI've noticed that https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#events-2 writes \"Event\" instead of \"Event or ErrorEvent\" for the event type `error`. Should it be added?",
